Question: 使用哪些基线进行评估？ Answer: 1000 random forests, 1000 random forests with 2.0 clipped, An Adan optimizer with a model with 128 and a one-layer, An Adan optimizer with a model with 512 hidden sizes and a one-layer, An Adan optimizer with a model with 512 hidden sizes and a two-layer, Hybrid training: An Adan optimizer with a model with 128 and a one-layer, An Adan optimizer with a model with 512 hidden sizes and a two-layer.
Question: 哪个组件影响最小？ Answer: 2D graph
Question: 哪个组件对性能影响最大？ Answer: 语言模型
